  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan takes it from the immortal zombie of Bo Qing at Falling Heavenly River, recognizing it from information obtained through Feng Jin Huang.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bo_qing",
          "loc_falling_heavenly_river",
          "char_feng_jin_huang"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After his fifth earthly calamity, he uses it in Lang Ya blessed land to increase his sword path dao marks. He is still only rank six then, so activating this rank seven Gu puts a heavy burden on his green grape immortal essence and he cannot use it freely.",
        "chapters": [
          1173
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "dao-mark-cultivation",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, while transformed into an ancient sword dragon, the dao marks from that cultivation help push his sword path dao marks to ten thousand.",
        "chapters": [
          1204
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sword-path-total",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
